CCTPBridgeModule_Validate
├── when params length is less than 32 bytes
│   └── it should return (false, "Invalid params encoding")
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it should return (false, "Zero bridge amount")
├── when token is not USDC
│   └── it should return (false, "Only USDC supported")
├── when destination domain is not configured
│   └── it should return (false, "Domain not configured")
├── when maxFee is greater than or equal to amount
│   └── it should return (false, "Max fee exceeds amount")
├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   └── it should return (false, "Insufficient balance")
└── when all checks pass
    └── it should return (true, "")
